+        // eDuo: when the core runs faster than real time (fast forward, unthrottled) it must not
+        // wait for the display. MoltenVK only offers FIFO and takes the CAMetalDrawable inside
+        // vkQueueSubmit, which the present thread calls under the scheduler's submit mutex: at one
